# ResumeAI frontend — environment template.
# Copy this file to `.env` (or `.env.local`) and fill in real values.
#   (.env.local and .env are gitignored — never commit secrets.)
#
# Used by the Vite dev server and by `npm run build` (values are baked in at
# build time, so production builds read the server's build-time env).
#
# VITE_API_URL — REQUIRED for production builds. The base URL of the Django
# REST API (everything under /api/), e.g. https://api.example.com/api.
# Without it, a production build falls back to same-origin `/api`, which only
# works when the SPA is hosted on the same origin as the API.
#
# Not needed for local development: leave it unset (or set to /api). The Vite
# dev server proxies /api to the Django backend on http://127.0.0.1:8000
# (see vite.config.ts), so development is same-origin and CORS-free.
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com/api